From cfc5fc0cfd484b3cd744ae20effeff245bda7afe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bff-rebase <kampeas@post.bgu.ac.il>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 14:37:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Support ssd offload

Add Mooncake SSD offload (Mode A): ReplicateConfig-based put, lazy store init
under fabric-mem, enable_ssd_offload/ssd_offload_path config (+ MOONCAKE_MASTER /
MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE env), per-rank SSD dirs, and guarded get/exists.
Requires Mooncake v0.3.11+ (setup() SSD kwargs). Rebased to vllm-ascend v0.19.1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
